    "body": "> `element.getAttribute('id') === null`\r\n\r\nSo the attribute would be deleted from the node? i.e.\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<label for=\"some-id\">Banana</label> <!-- before -->\r\n<label>Banana</label>               <!-- after -->\r\n```",
